agentic-code-reviewers v0.4.0 (cursor-sdk)

⚠️ **WARNING:** `runGc` purges expired scratch/review files and compacts shipped plans, then rebuilds compiled views and the FTS index, but never calls `commitVaultChange`. For users with opt-in vault git sync, GC mutations therefore remain uncommitted while upserts are committed, breaking cross-machine consistency and failing vault-git AC2 (GC compacting operations must create structured commits). After GC on one machine, `memo sync` will not propagate purges or plan compactions to other workstations.

**Correção sugerida:**

```ts
import { getVaultRoot, ensureVaultStructure, ensureProjectVault, withVaultLock, commitVaultChange } from './vault.js';

// inside runGc, after rebuildIndex when !dryRun:
    rebuildCompiledViews(projectId, vaultRoot);
    await rebuildIndex(vaultRoot);
    rebuiltFts = true;
    commitVaultChange(
      `gc ${projectId}: purged scratch=${purgedScratchCount} review=${purgedReviewCount} compacted=${compactedPlansCount}`,
      vaultRoot
    );
```

<details>
<summary>🔍 Detalhes da Análise IA</summary>

**Score:** 7/10 | **Ação dev:** fix-code

**Análise:**
1. Evidence: `curator.ts:211-215` runs `rebuildCompiledViews` and `rebuildIndex` when not dry-run, then returns without any git commit. Repo-wide grep confirms `commitVaultChange` exists only in `upsertRecord`. Vault-git spec AC2 explicitly lists GC compacting among operations that must commit. 2. Scenario: Enable vault git, accumulate expired scratch files, run `memo gc`. Files are deleted/compacted on disk and index rebuilt, but `git -C $SPEC_MEMO_ROOT log -1` shows no GC commit; remote vault clone retains expired records. 3. Protection: `curator.test.ts` validates purge counts and sanitized MCP output but never enables `vaultGit` or inspects git history after `runGc`. 4. Discards: `rebuildIndex` already runs under `withVaultLock` (including when called from `runGc`); the missing behavior is git persistence, not index rebuild race.

**Caminhos analisados:** /src/curator.ts, /src/vault.ts, /.agents/specs/vault-git.spec.md, /src/curator.test.ts
</details>
